# Project Ambrose by Imjustchico
# The install scanner's default rules: the launcher and bug reporter files whose Src names a Windows folder the install does not have, and the files a played install writes for itself that no manifest lists.
Windows/Bin/BugReporter.exe|Bin/BugReporter.exe|Base|4
Windows/Bin/KIBugReportBuilderCSR.dll|Bin/KIBugReportBuilderCSR.dll|Base|4
Windows/Bin/PatchConfig.xml|Bin/PatchConfig.xml|Base|4
Windows/PatchClient/Configurator.exe|Configurator.exe|PatchClient|4
Windows/PatchClient/PatchConfig.xml|PatchConfig.xml|PatchClient|4
Windows/PatchClient/WizardLauncher.exe|WizardLauncher.exe|PatchClient|4
Windows/PatchClient/WizardLauncherUI.dll|WizardLauncherUI.dll|PatchClient|4
Windows/PatchClient/wizard101.skf|wizard101.skf|PatchClient|4
skip|PatchInfo/**
skip|Data/GameData/CharacterRegistry/**
skip|Data/GameData/ActionList.xml
skip|Data/GameData/InputBindings.xml
skip|Data/GameData/defaultconfig.xml
skip|Bin/*.log
skip|Bin/*.dmp
skip|Bin/*.bak
skip|Bin/config.xml
skip|Bin/preferences.xml
skip|Bin/previouscommands.xml
skip|Bin/state.dat
skip|Bin/queued_packages.txt
skip|Bin/BrowserWhitelist.xml
skip|Bin/chrome_*.pak
skip|Bin/resources.pak
skip|Bin/icudtl.dat
skip|Bin/libcef.dll
skip|Bin/libEGL.dll
skip|Bin/libGLESv2.dll
skip|Bin/chrome_elf.dll
skip|Bin/snapshot_blob.bin
skip|Bin/v8_context_snapshot.bin
skip|Bin/vk_swiftshader*
skip|Bin/vulkan-1.dll
skip|Bin/d3dcompiler_47.dll
skip|Bin/KIWebHelper.exe
skip|Bin/KIBrowser.ver
skip|Bin/CEF_LICENSE.txt
skip|Bin/KIChromiumEmbeddedFrameworkCSR.dll
skip|Bin/locales/**
skip|AppStart.dat
skip|Install Log.txt
skip|LocalPackagesList.txt
skip|NoLangChange.txt
skip|Wiz.ico
skip|Wizard101.exe
skip|PatchClient/**/*.patch
skip|PatchClient/WizardLauncher.Log*.txt
skip|PatchClient/PatchConfig.xml*.bak
